        "id": 1000835
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-01-15T17:02:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So inbound traffic will only work if new addresses don\u0027t appear between the time the transform is created and applied. If we do allow this (and I\u0027m not convinced that we should) then we must at least warn against this possibility and of its consequences. (Inbound traffic doesn\u0027t work at all?)",
